{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":31,"ref":"2-chronicles 29:31","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"yo","chapter":29,"translation":"Yechizqiyahu dáhùn, ó sì wí pé, Nísinsin è ti kún ọwọ́ yín fún Yahweh; ẹ sún wá, ẹ kó ẹbọ-ìpẹ̀ àti ẹbọ-ìdúpẹ́ wá sí ilé Yahweh. Nígbà náà ni ajọ̀pọ̀ náà kó ẹbọ-ìpẹ̀ àti ẹbọ-ìdúpẹ́ wá; àti ẹnikẹ́ni tí ọkàn rẹ̀ jẹ́ olùfẹ́ kó ẹbọ-nípa wá.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויען","gloss":"dáhùn"},{"surface":"יחזקיהו","gloss":"Yechizqiyahu"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"ó sì wí pé"},{"surface":"עתה","gloss":"nísinsin"},{"surface":"מלאתם","gloss":"è ti kún"},{"surface":"ידכם","gloss":"ọwọ́ yín"},{"surface":"ליהוה","gloss":"fún Yahweh"},{"surface":"גשו","gloss":"ẹ sún wá"},{"surface":"והביאו","gloss":"ẹ kó … wá"},{"surface":"זבחים","gloss":"ẹbọ-ìpẹ̀"},{"surface":"ותודות","gloss":"àti ẹbọ-ìdúpẹ́"},{"surface":"לבית","gloss":"sí ilé"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"ויביאו","gloss":"nígbà náà ni … kó wá"},{"surface":"הקהל","gloss":"ajọ̀pọ̀ náà"},{"surface":"זבחים","gloss":"ẹbọ-ìpẹ̀"},{"surface":"ותודות","gloss":"àti ẹbọ-ìdúpẹ́"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"àti ẹnikẹ́ni tí"},{"surface":"נדיב","gloss":"olùfẹ́ (aláilọ́kọ)"},{"surface":"לב","gloss":"ọkàn"},{"surface":"עלות","gloss":"ẹbọ-nípa"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:34:46.098167064Z","model":"glm-5.3"}